---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro'; import Breadcrumbs from '../../components/Breadcrumbs.astro'; import QuickAnswer from '../../components/QuickAnswer.astro'; import LastVerified from '../../components/LastVerified.astro'; import GuideCard from '../../components/GuideCard.astro'; import SourceList from '../../components/SourceList.astro'; import { sourceUrls } from '../../data/sources';
const title='DragonSword Awakening Builds — Roles, Runes & Team Order'; const description='DragonSword Awakening builds explained through Hero roles, Karma, Runes, skill priorities, team order and Status/Signal synergy without pretending verified meta builds exist.'; const canonical='https://dragonswordguide.com/builds/'; const article={ '@context':'https://schema.org','@type':'Article',headline:title,description,mainEntityOfPage:canonical,datePublished:'2026-08-08',dateModified:'2026-08-08',publisher:{'@type':'Organization',name:'DragonSword Guide'} }; const sources=[{label:'Official Steam store page',href:sourceUrls.steam,note:'supports the shared Status Ailment, Signal Skill and switching concepts behind build planning.'}];
---
<BaseLayout title={title} description={description} canonical={canonical} ogType="article" schema={[article]}><div class="shell page-wrap"><Breadcrumbs items={[{label:'DragonSword Guide',href:'/'},{label:'Builds'}]}/><article><header class="article-header"><p class="eyebrow">Build lab · Testing in progress</p><h1>DragonSword Awakening Builds</h1><LastVerified date="August 8, 2026"/></header><QuickAnswer title="Verified builds are being added as retail-build testing is completed."><p>For now, use build language that survives missing data: Hero role, Karma, Runes, skill priorities, team order and Status/Signal synergy. We are not naming a “best build” without current first-hand testing.</p></QuickAnswer><div class="copy"><h2>What defines a build?</h2><p>A build is the interaction between a Hero’s kit, the resources assigned to it and the place it occupies in a three-Hero sequence. A single damage number cannot represent that interaction.</p><h2>What we will verify next</h2><div class="card-grid"><GuideCard href="/characters/" title="Hero role" description="Identity and combat behavior, added only when verified."/><GuideCard href="/systems/runes/" title="Runes" description="Capacity and synthesis facts are current; optimal farming is not."/><GuideCard href="/teams/" title="Team order" description="Setup, connector and finisher logic without a fake tier list."/></div><h2>Why there is no meta list yet</h2><p>Retail balance, unlock routes and exact skill interactions need direct play data. A polished guide should make that boundary obvious instead of converting research notes into certainty.</p></div><SourceList sources={sources}/></article></div></BaseLayout>
<style>.page-wrap{padding:1.25rem 0 2rem}.article-header{max-width:820px;margin-bottom:1.5rem}.eyebrow{color:var(--accent-light);font-size:.72rem;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase}h1,h2{line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:-.04em}h1{font-size:clamp(2.4rem,7vw,5rem);margin:0 0 .7rem}h2{font-size:clamp(1.45rem,3vw,2rem);margin:2.5rem 0 .7rem}.copy{max-width:800px}.copy p{color:var(--muted-strong)}.card-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:.75rem}@media(max-width:700px){.card-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}}</style>
